---
import TextLink from '../ui/TextLink.astro';
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
  <div class="container-site grid-site studio">
    <p class="t-label studio-label">05 · studio note</p>
    <div class="studio-body">
      <h2 id="studio-title" class="t-h2 studio-title">A small studio, on purpose.</h2>
      <p class="studio-text">
        IsmailApps is led by Ismail, who scopes every project and stays accountable from the first call to maintenance.
        For each build we bring in specialists from a trusted network (design, mobile, QA, DevOps and AI engineering), so
        you get the right people for the work without paying for an agency's overhead.
      </p>
      <p class="studio-small">
        We work from Pakistan with clients in Europe and the United States.
      </p>
      <TextLink href="/about">About the studio</TextLink>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .studio {
    row-gap: 1rem;
  }
  .studio-label,
  .studio-body {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .studio-label {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .studio-title {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .studio-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
  .studio-small {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }
  @media (width >= 56.25rem) {
    .studio-label {
      grid-column: 1 / span 3;
      padding-top: 0.6rem;
    }
    .studio-body {
      grid-column: 4 / span 8;
    }
  }
</style>
